<title>UK: FEK sets 10 bln yen two-year dual-currency bond.</title>
<headline>FEK sets 10 bln yen two-year dual-currency bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following dual-currency bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FINNISH EXPORT CREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON     4.00	MATURITY    25.NOV.98</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	  ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE    25.NOV.96</p>
<p> NOTES    REDEMPTION IN U.S. DOLLARS. $4,399.47 PER 500,000 YEN</p>
<p>	    LIMITED FOREX PROTECTION</p>
<p>	    ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
